  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PSF Strategic Framework  - SAFER Salvage Operation Project (S.S.O.P.)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;This project, as a special initiative within the framework of the Peace Support Facility for Yemen, aims at preventing a catastrophic oil spill occurring in the Red Sea with a potentially disastrous impact. This is proposed to be achieved by: assessing the situation and mobilising salvage assets (including a Very Large Crude Carrier - VLCC); offloading the oil from the Floating Storage and Offloading (FSO) vessel Safer to the VLCC; placing an oil-spill contingency response on stand-by; and establishing the conditions for the disposal of FSO Safer once a longer-term storage solution has been agreed.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
